, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:01:55.48,0:01:57.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur biraz, Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.39,0:02:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? Ne o-Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gitmeden önce pantolon giy!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.49,0:02:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden hiç öğrenmiyorsun, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.35,0:02:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şehre öyle gidersen,  insanlar sana yine ucube diyecekler.Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.94,0:02:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her neyse.  Sadece birkaç malzeme alacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.42,0:02:14.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam git o zaman.Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.41,0:02:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peh! Tom-san'ın beraatını önceden kutlamak için tam bir şölen yapıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.51,0:02:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zaten başından beri masumdu.Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh... Pekâla.Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.91,0:02:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Tom-san, Iceburg! Uyanın!Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.24,0:02:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugün duruşma günü!Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.22,0:02:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Git hükmünü al gel!Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.50,0:02:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir an önce limana!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.04,0:02:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom'un davasında karar vermek üzereler!Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu duruşma çok dikkat çekiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.74,0:02:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiye çok sayıda izleyici geliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz trenini gördünüz mü acaba?Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet. Bir kez bindim.Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.94,0:03:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aslında bu kadar iyi çalışmasından etkilendim.Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.28,0:03:06.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık dört ada birleştiğine göre,...Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.59,0:03:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...kimse beraat etmesinden şikayetçi olmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.97,0:03:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom daha gelmedi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.99,0:03:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acaba bir şey mi oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çabuk! Boş yer bulmalıyız!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.68,0:03:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, hüküm anında orada olmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.15,0:03:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar nostaljik. 14 koca yıl geçti.Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Patlama mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiyi terkedin! Çabuk! Hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne?! Korsan saldırısı mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Saldırı nereden geliyor?Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.28,0:03:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oradan!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimin filosu o?Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.89,0:04:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O filoyu daha önce hiç görmedim. Nereden çıktı bu korsanlar?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.15,0:04:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O silah kaplı gemiler de ne öyle?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Limandan uzaklaşın! Kaçın! Çabuk!Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.36,0:04:26.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen şehre gidin!Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.36,0:04:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin! Oğlum tuzağa düştü!Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.11,0:04:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye...?Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.29,0:04:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim o?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.71,0:04:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Benim...Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim gemilerim...Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.64,0:04:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, başımız dertte!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.59,0:04:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky'nin gemileri adli gemiye saldırıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.08,0:04:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur biraz! O Franky olamaz! Franky şu anda şehirde!Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.87,0:05:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum. O böyle bir şey yapmaz.Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni en fazla endişelendiren de bu zaten!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.53,0:05:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları durduralım, Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.18,0:05:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam.Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.38,0:05:10.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar mı yoksa Hükümet mi?Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.00,0:05:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saklanın!Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes kaçsın!Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Limandan uzaklaşın!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babam hala gemide!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu affedilemez!Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.26,0:05:33.81,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Kim o?!  Gemilerimi kim kullanıyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele edin efendim!Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.68,0:05:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi fazla dayanmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.79,0:05:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O filo da ne öyle?Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.66,0:05:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırı başarılı oldu.Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.46,0:05:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi. Hemen bir sonraki aşamaya geçin.Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu, adalet adına verilen bir kurban.Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.75,0:05:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.98,0:06:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık duruşmaya başlayalım mı,...Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.67,0:06:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Tom'un Çalışanları?Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.61,0:06:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adli gemi batıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.01,0:06:20.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam! Hurda Adası'na geri dönelim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.43,0:06:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlaşıldı!Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.75,0:06:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Filo gidiyor!Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.09,0:06:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur biraz. O gemileri tanıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, gemiler geri geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.27,0:06:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kıyıya yakınlar! Onları yakalayalım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gemileri kullanmak için ne kötü bir yol!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.47,0:06:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İki kişi Hurda Adası'ndan bize doğru koşuyor!Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu Tom.Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.76,0:06:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, gemiyi terkedin.Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.56,0:07:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.23,0:07:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada kimse yok.Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.88,0:07:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada da. Bu gemilerin hepsi boş.Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.12,0:07:09.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.56,0:07:12.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar da Franky'nin.Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.94,0:07:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikkat et, Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin...Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.79,0:07:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battle Frankyler alev almış!Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg! Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.15,0:07:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, ikiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.07,0:07:50.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor?! Ne oldu?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.41,0:07:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin? Hey! Ice-Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.22,0:08:13.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha önce gelen istihbarat ajanları...Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.91,0:08:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...savaş gemilerini kullandılar!Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi gemim tarafından mı vuruldu?Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.36,0:08:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana defalarca kez...Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...söylemiştim.Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.36,0:08:30.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bu gemileri etrafta tutacak kadar soğukkanlı olabilirsin?Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.55,0:08:35.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu silahların sorumluluğunu üstlenmelisin, Aptalanky!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.72,0:08:38.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san kendi gemimle vuruldu!Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.84,0:08:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinle.Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.77,0:08:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ürettiğimiz silahlar ölümcüldür.Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niyetin bu olmasa bile...Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...silahlar hep başkalarını incitmek için kullanılacak!Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.90,0:08:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önemsediğin insanları bile!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.54,0:09:00.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet'in oyununa geldik.Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.15,0:09:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adli gemiye saldırmaktan dolayı suçlanacağız.Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O adamlar planları istiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.97,0:09:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu istedikleri gibi soruşturabilmek için Tom-san'ı suçlamaları gerekiyor!Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.07,0:09:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun gerçekten senin hatan olmadığını söyleyebilir misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.04,0:09:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san bu yüzden götürülürse,...Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...seni...Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.70,0:09:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...asla affetmeyeceğim, Franky!!Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.61,0:09:29.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana inana-Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeter!Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.26,0:09:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.60,0:09:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu suçlamamalısın, Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.97,0:09:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu Franky'nin hatası değil!Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.31,0:09:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl hala böyle diyebilirsin?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.47,0:09:42.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.36,0:09:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzgünüm! Bu zıpkını ben yapmıştım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.77,0:09:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyi delerse geri çıkarılamayacak şekilde yapmıştım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.07,0:09:51.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.25,0:09:56.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür dileme! Hissetmiyorum bile.Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakın, oradalar!Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom vurulmuş! Bunu ona ne yapmış olabilir?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.57,0:10:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırıyı planlayanlar onlar değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.56,0:10:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şehir halkı.Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.61,0:10:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâla, şehre gidelim mi?Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni pislik, Spanda!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam.Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saygıdeğer suçlularım.Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırganlar bunlar.Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korkmayın, iyi vatandaşlar.Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.88,0:10:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz, CP5, onları zaten yakaladık.Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamamiyle etkisiz haldeler.Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Duruşmayı bekleselerdi, beraat ederdi.Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom bunu niye yaptı?Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.36,0:10:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu, hala korsanlarla işbirliği yaptığı anlamına mı geliyor?Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.67,0:10:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tanıştığımıza memnun oldum. Ben CP5'ten Spandam.Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.78,0:10:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize yardımcı olmak için burada bulunmanız ne şans.Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.66,0:10:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen sanığı gözaltına almamıza izin verin.Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.94,0:10:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları sorgulamak istiyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.90,0:10:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.28,0:11:05.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne istersen söyle. Sarsabileceğinden fazla güvenilirliğim var!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.51,0:11:09.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Antik silahın planları artık benim sayılır.Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.61,0:11:10.69,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak.Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.69,0:11:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun olduğuna inanamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.07,0:11:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öncelikle deniz treninin, mühendislik harikasından başka bir şey olmadığını söylemeliyim.Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.83,0:11:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle Water 7 için yeni bir dönem başlatacak.Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.52,0:11:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ancak Gold Roger'ın gemisini yapma suçundan beraat edecekken,...Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.76,0:11:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bir suç daha işlemene şaşırdım.Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.21,0:11:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalama!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.18,0:11:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adli gemi saldırısının arkasında biz yokuz!Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.39,0:11:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu yapan şu pislik Spandam'dı!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şaka yapıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.87,0:11:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom'un çırağı ne tür bir saçmalık uydurmaya çalışıyor?Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.09,0:12:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet ajansı CP5'in adli bir gemiyi batırmakla eline ne geçer ki?Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.19,0:12:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne saçmalık ama! Gülünç bir şey!Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam'dı, değil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.69,0:12:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başlangıç olarak, seni saldıran gemilerin üstünde suçüstü yakaladık!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.54,0:12:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa onları senin yapmış olduğunu kabul etmeyecek misin?Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.65,0:12:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gemiler böyle bir canavarlık teşebbüsünde bulundu.Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar artık...Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...benim gemilerim değil!Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.08,0:12:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom kelepçelerini kırdı!Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nişan al!Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.25,0:12:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, daha önce hiç Franky'ye vurmamıştı.Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.97,0:12:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.20,0:13:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Artık senin değiller", demek?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.51,0:13:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu asla söylememen gereken bir şey!Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.54,0:13:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu söylemenin nesi yanlış?! Onları yaptığıma bile pişmanım!Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.92,0:13:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gemileri yapmamış olsaydım, hiç kimse yaralanmazdı!Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi yapma işi...Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.81,0:13:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...iyi veya kötü değildir!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.02,0:13:31.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl gemiler yapacağın umrumda değil!Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.23,0:13:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.66,0:13:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...o gemiler insanları yaralamak veya dünyayı yok etmek için kullanılsa bile...Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.09,0:13:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...yapımcısı onları koşulsuz olarak sevmelidir!Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.49,0:13:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlardan asla şüphe etmemeli!Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.79,0:13:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemilerini suçlama!Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.51,0:13:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir adam gemi yaptığında  ona DON'la gururunu koyar!Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg... Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.25,0:14:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu anda ne olursa olsun karışmayın.Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.77,0:14:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle karışmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.00,0:14:27.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet bu suçlamaları bana yöneltti. Hükümet hükmünü verecek.Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Adımı temize çıkarma umudum yok.Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım buraya kadarmış.Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.05,0:14:37.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Masum ve saf gemilerinin böyle içler acısı bir şekilde kullanılmış olması seni incitmiş olmalı.Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.30,0:14:41.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Eminim onu yumruklamak istiyorsundur, Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.54,0:14:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Tom delirdi!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.16,0:14:56.54,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.76,0:14:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyor bu?Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.02,0:14:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen dur!Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona saldırırsan,...Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.00,0:15:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun acısını...Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.09,0:15:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...hissetme vaktin geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.39,0:15:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-ATEŞ!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.81,0:15:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.81,0:15:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh... Onu vurdular...Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!!Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.99,0:15:26.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakinleştirici saçmalar.Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.91,0:15:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu hakettin, seni canavar balık adam!Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.37,0:15:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, bunu niye yaptın?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.58,0:15:41.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, sersemler! Ne diye bekliyorsunuz?! Hemen tutuklayın onları!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom'un Çalışanları'nı  Enies Lobby'ye götürüyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom'un bu kadar sert biri olduğunu hiç bilmiyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.87,0:15:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aklından ne geçiyor olabilir?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.22,0:15:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten ruhunu korsanlara satmış!Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.64,0:15:58.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç tane savaş gemisi yaptığına bak!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi pislikler! Tom-san hakkında böyle konuşmaya nasıl cüret-Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.69,0:16:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sessiz ol!Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.78,0:16:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.88,0:16:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırak ne derlerse desinler.Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.11,0:16:05.74,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.59,0:16:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sayın Yargıç.Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.61,0:16:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.24,0:16:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adli gemiye saldırdığımı itiraf ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, Tom-san! Bunu yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.58,0:16:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bir isteğim var.Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Afedersin, balık adam! Bir suçlunun isteğini kim-Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa çeneni, CP5!Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İsteğin nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.01,0:16:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz trenini yaptığım için, hizmetimin karşılığı olarak bir suçu silme konusunda ciddiyseniz,...Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.97,0:16:35.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bugünkü suçu silmenizi istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.54,0:16:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu isteğini kabul etseydim bile başladığımız yere geri dönmüş olurduk.Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.27,0:16:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine de Korsanlar Kralı için bir gemi yapmış olma suçuna cevap vermen gerekirdi.Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! İstediğim bu.Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.71,0:16:52.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger için gemi yaptığım zamanı düşününce,...Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.22,0:16:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ona DON'la en büyük onurumu koydum!Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne küstahça bir beyanat!Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.28,0:17:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı'na yardım etmekten gurur mu duyuyor?Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.65,0:17:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni hain!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.61,0:17:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Vahşi balık adam! – Lanet olası balık!Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.27,0:17:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san! Niye?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.76,0:17:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boş ver onları. Beni dinleyin. Kendinizi suçlamayın.Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.50,0:17:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükümet'in planlar konusunda bu kadar umutsuz olduğunu bilmiyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.39,0:17:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger'la olan ilişkim,  beni dezavantajlı bir duruma soktu.Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.99,0:17:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama bu demek değil ki-Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endişelenmeyin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.83,0:17:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bakın. Suçlamalar 14 yıl öncesinden yapıldı ama o zamandan beri çok şey değişti.Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.70,0:17:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ada, nihayet ihtiyaç duyduğu güce sahip.Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu andan itibaren...Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.63,0:17:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bana bir şey olsa bile,...Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.89,0:17:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bu şehrin gücünün bir parçası olacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.26,0:17:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayalim...Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.22,0:17:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...nihayet gerçekleşti ve çalışıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.84,0:17:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.27,0:18:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.59,0:18:08.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg, Franky,Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.81,0:18:11.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...planları koruyun.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san, Yokozuna,...Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...her şey için sağolun.Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakinleştirici mermiler nihayet işe yaradı!Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.87,0:18:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adli gemiye saldırdıkları için onları tutuklayın!Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emredersiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.05,0:18:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun.Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O suçlamalar geri alındı.Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.65,0:18:38.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı Gold Roger'ın gemisini yapma suçundan ötürü...Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.15,0:18:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...gemi yapım mühendisi Tom, Enies Lobby'ye götürülecek.Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi bu kadar.Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.18,0:18:50.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin. Yaşlı adam bu dava için aşırı merhametliydi.Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.07,0:18:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse önemli değil.  Çıraklara ihtiyacım yok.Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.68,0:18:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çırakları bırakın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.05,0:19:03.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san için yapabileceğimiz bir şey yok.Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.47,0:19:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünya Hükümeti'ne kimse karşı gelemez.Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendinizi tutmalısınız.Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.64,0:19:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san sizi kurtardı!Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.85,0:19:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlarla dövüşmeye çalışırsanız, fazlasıyla sinirlendireceksiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.52,0:19:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby, Hükümet'in Adli Ada'sı!Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.43,0:19:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oraya gönderilen hiçbir suçlu...Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.64,0:19:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...canlı geri dönmedi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz trenini hazırladık efendim!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.69,0:19:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hazır olduğunuzda onu götürebiliriz! – Tamam!Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san...Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, gerzekler! Onu arabaya taşıyın!Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.66,0:19:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.87,0:19:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni aşırı şişmiş, kalamar balık adam!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.66,0:19:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...dayanamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Vırak! – Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.88,0:19:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.14,0:19:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.47,0:19:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.08,0:20:03.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam'ın yüzünü mahvetti!Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.68,0:20:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi de Tom'un çırakları delirdi!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.31,0:20:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen dur!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.99,0:20:11.90,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.90,0:20:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tutuklayın onu! Onu da götüreceğiz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.24,0:20:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana uyar! Onu götürmenize izin vermeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.02,0:20:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atış serbest!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.75,0:20:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san'ı geri verin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.47,0:20:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah...Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.42,0:20:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hemen kaç!Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ateş!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Kaçtı!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet olası Cutty Flam. Kahrolası velet! Bunu ödeyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.61,0:20:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da artık suçlu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.19,0:20:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onunla işim bittiğinde, asıldığını göreceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.29,0:21:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.07,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne var?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Cutty Flam!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.19,0:21:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizde bizi takip etmiş!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.09,0:21:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elinde silahla raylarda duruyor!Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orada kal, Yokozuna.Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.63,0:21:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vır-vırak.Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.57,0:21:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Embesil mi, bu?Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.35,0:21:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emriniz nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.43,0:21:22.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de mi embesilsin?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.90,0:21:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üzerinden geçip gidin! Yapmamızı istediği şey bu.Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.22,0:21:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endişelenecek bir şeyimiz yok!Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.89,0:21:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Emredersiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.77,0:21:34.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur, Üfleyen Tom!Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.61,0:21:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaratıcını nereye götürüyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vırak, vırak!Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.22,0:21:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geçmene izin vermeyeceğim!Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.03,0:22:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san'ı geri ver!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.22,0:22:09.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur, deniz treni!Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.60,0:22:18.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum. Demek baban seni terketti. Ne aptalca ama!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.58,0:22:20.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, komik değildi!Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.33,0:22:22.78,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, seni DON'la alacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.21,0:22:24.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san,...Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.32,0:22:26.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...artık...Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.66,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...gemi yapmak istemiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.48,0:22:34.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Önemsediğim insanları yaralayan gemiler, sevmeye değmez!Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Tom-san,...Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.67,0:22:41.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...yine de senin gibi olmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.33,0:22:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.66,0:22:53.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri gel! Yine bana bir şeyler öğret!Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.31,0:23:04.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün...Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.55,0:23:07.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,...hayalimdeki gemiyi yapmak istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.60,0:23:17.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm dünyayı dolaşacak ve uzak denizlerdeki dalgaları DON'la yakalayacak bir gemi!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.01,0:23:19.94,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir rüya gemi!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:14.41,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:23:20.40,0:23:26.36,Author,,0,0,0,,TR: onepacetr.net | kazaskerDialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:14.41,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-sanDialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:14.41,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-sanDialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.93,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Mahkeme Kararı GünüDialogue: 2,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.93,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Mahkeme Kararı GünüDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 2,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 1,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 2,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,PhosCityDialogue: 1,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,PhosCityDialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 1,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 2,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Aspiring Shoulder JT-421                  RavenfireDialogue: 1,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Aspiring Shoulder JT-421                  RavenfireDialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 1,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 2,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TranslationDialogue: 0,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,archıt3cht GaijinDialogue: 1,0:01:38.93,0:01:43.10,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,archıt3cht GaijinDialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:08.05,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Sorun yok! Yola çıkalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.31,0:00:11.59,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Güneşi hep kalbimizde tutacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:15.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Birleşmiş ellerimiz bize güç veriyor! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:18.68,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayallerimizi yakalayacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:32.49,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Birleşmiş güçlerimizle dev bir dalgaya bineceğiz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:40.29,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,1,,♪ İşte işaret! Başarıya doğru acele edelim! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:47.13,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bu bizim yola çıkma vaktimiz. Bir kez demir alınca...Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:55.01,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...gökkuşağı renkli rüzgarla macera denizine doğru yola çıkacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:58.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bu sıkıntıyla dolu bir yolculuk...Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:02.27,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...ama orada önemli bir şey var. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:06.35,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Başın derde girerse,...Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.45,0:01:08.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...yardım etmek için orada olacağım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.45,0:01:13.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Sorun yok! Yola çıkalım! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:16.82,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Güneşi hep kalbimizde tutacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:20.33,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bir fırtına gelirse omzunu benimkine yasla. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:24.20,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ İlerideki umut ışığına bakacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.67,0:01:27.92,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayallerimizin parçalarını toplarken,...Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.39,0:01:31.55,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,...bize yarının yolunu gösterecekler! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.72,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Bu yüzden aynı bayrak altında yolculuk ediyoruz. ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.10,0:01:38.36,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Hayallerimizi yakalayacağız! ♪Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.45,Lyrics-OP5,,0,0,0,,♪ Biz birleşmişiz...